From: Bernhard Geier <2651739+citronalco@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 20:05:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Apache, PHP: increase max_input_vars

Fixes https://github.com/MythTV/mythweb/issues/38
---
 mythtv/mythplugins/mythweb/mythweb.conf.apache | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/mythtv/mythplugins/mythweb/mythweb.conf.apache b/mythtv/mythplugins/mythweb/mythweb.conf.apache
index c5da6061..4c839450 100644
--- a/mythtv/mythplugins/mythweb/mythweb.conf.apache
+++ b/mythtv/mythplugins/mythweb/mythweb.conf.apache
@@ -106,6 +106,7 @@
     #
 
         <Files *.php>
+            php_value max_input_vars                30000
 
         #  These settings are intended for apache 2.x.  If your version of apache
         #  doesn't support php_value, or things like memory_limit aren't working
